// Public API rules, enforced by an ArchUnit test in CI:
//  - no edu.wpi.first.wpilibj.smartdashboard.* or .shuffleboard.* in any public signature
//  - no `extends` requirement on user subsystems; composition + interfaces only
//  - all angles/distances/currents as Measure<...>, never raw double, and never mutable units
//  - field-relative math routed through RootstockField, not inlined, so the 2027 origin change is one file
//  - RobotIdentity always has a deploy-file fallback (no jumper/serial dependency)
