landscape.integrationShape:
Drop `LimelightHelpers.java` into `src/main/java/frc/robot/`. Preferred hot path is raw NT (avoids per-call table lookups and lets you use `readQueue()` to get every frame, not just the latest):
```java
var t = NetworkTableInstance.getDefault().getTable(name);
DoubleArrayPublisher orientation = t.getDoubleArrayTopic("robot_orientation_set").publish();
DoubleArraySubscriber mt2 = t.getDoubleArrayTopic("botpose_orb_wpiblue").subscribe(new double[]{});
DoubleSubscriber tl = t.getDoubleTopic("tl").subscribe(0.0);
// every loop, BEFORE reading:
orientation.accept(new double[]{yawDeg,0,0,0,0,0});
NetworkTableInstance.getDefault().flush();
for (var s : mt2.readQueue()) {
  double ts = s.timestamp*1e-6 - s.value[6]*1e-3;   // NT server publish time minus total latency ms
  Pose3d p = new Pose3d(s.value[0],s.value[1],s.value[2],
      new Rotation3d(Math.toRadians(s.value[3]),Math.toRadians(s.value[4]),Math.toRadians(s.value[5])));
  int tagCount=(int)s.value[7]; double tagSpan=s.value[8], avgDist=s.value[9], avgArea=s.value[10];
  for (int i=11;i<s.value.length;i+=7) { int id=(int)s.value[i]; /* per-tag block, stride 7 */ }
}
```
Botpose array packing (verified against AdvantageKit `VisionIOLimelight`): [0..5]=x,y,z,roll,pitch,yaw(deg); [6]=total latency ms; [7]=tagCount; [8]=tagSpan; [9]=avgTagDist; [10]=avgTagArea; [11+]=per-tag blocks of 7 starting with tag id; MegaTag1 index 17 = first-tag ambiguity.

```java
PhotonCamera cam = new PhotonCamera("front-left");
PhotonPoseEstimator est = new PhotonPoseEstimator(
    AprilTagFieldLayout.loadField(AprilTagFields.k2026RebuiltWelded), ROBOT_TO_CAM);
// every loop, before estimating, if using trig/constrained strategies:
est.addHeadingData(Timer.getFPGATimestamp(), gyro.getRotation2d());
for (PhotonPipelineResult r : cam.getAllUnreadResults()) {
  Optional<EstimatedRobotPose> e = est.estimateCoprocMultiTagPose(r);
  if (e.isEmpty()) e = est.estimateLowestAmbiguityPose(r);
  e.ifPresent(p -> consumer.accept(p.estimatedPose.toPose2d(), p.timestampSeconds, stdDevs(r)));
}
```
Full verified `PhotonPoseEstimator` surface: ctor `(AprilTagFieldLayout, Transform3d)` (2-arg is the live one; 3-arg with `PoseStrategy` is `@Deprecated(forRemoval=true, since="2026")`); `estimateCoprocMultiTagPose(PhotonPipelineResult)`, `estimateRioMultiTagPose(result, Matrix<N3,N3>, Matrix<N8,N1>)`, `estimateLowestAmbiguityPose(result)`, `estimateClosestToCameraHeightPose(result)`, `estimateClosestToReferencePose(result, Pose3d)`, `estimateAverageBestTargetsPose(result)`, `estimatePnpDistanceTrigSolvePose(result)`, `estimateConstrainedSolvepnpPose(result, cameraMatrix, distCoeffs, Pose3d seedPose, boolean headingFree, double headingScaleFactor)`; `addHeadingData(double, Rotation3d|Rotation2d)`, `resetHeadingData(double, Rotation3d|Rotation2d)`, `getRobotToCameraTransform()/setRobotToCameraTransform(Transform3d)`, `getFieldTags()/setFieldTags`, `getTagModel()/setTagModel(TargetModel)`; nested `record ConstrainedSolvepnpParams(boolean headingFree, double headingScaleFactor)`. `EstimatedRobotPose` fields: `Pose3d estimatedPose`, `double timestampSeconds` (also `targetsUsed`, `strategy`).

